      "writtenOn": "2021-07-23T06:42:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC GPM6 is powered by VCC pin inside of the EC (see GCR29 in the ds), which is why I use the same 1.8V as external pullup source for this pin.\nIn this case I\u0027m not sure if you\u0027d need to set GPIO_SEL_1P8V here..",
