      "writtenOn": "2021-07-23T06:42:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The enable pin at the load switch is actually 5V-tolerant (w/ Vih \u003d 1V), I\u0027d suggest the EC just treat this pin as 3.3V I/O.\nAlso, IIUC IT81202 doesn\u0027t not support 1.8V push-pull output on GPIOs.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 53,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "624560405927289d9b40023bc7c37a3bd3820210",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
